{
 "about": "Spellings of one value at the other places of a condition: a number, a quoted string, a list or an attribute path on the left of ==, on either side of >, in IN, CONTAINS, CONTAINS ANY and IS SUBSET, and before IS NULL. Every probe is one side of an opposite pair: the same place holds the plain spelling in the other case, and the resource holds the value the token spells. The files are cut in the order the probes were chosen: must first.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R67_SPELLPOS_SHOULD_",
